                <pb facs="0620" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg500"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/993</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Peruvian Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Pezet</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July 15,
                        1922</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have been requested by Dr.
                    Porras to ask you to appoint a time on Monday next, July 17th when you could
                    receive him together with Dr. Aldunate of the Chilean Delegation; it having been
                    arranged between both Delegations at their last Joint <pb facs="0621" n="501"
                        xml:id="pg501"/> Session that they would appeal to you for advise on certain
                    points on which they could not agree.</p>
                <p>With my expression [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. A. Pezet</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
